<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "環境音\春の山.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田集集会所.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\集会場.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"It's 7 o'clock."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE><PG>
"Say, <STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-kun</STYLE>."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Is there any point to this..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"It's necessary, if only to prove my innocence. Please keep a proper watch on me."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"If another curse-killing happens after all this, it looks like I'll be the one under suspicion..."<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"But </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Shirozaki-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, your wife </STYLE><STYLE ID="3" RUBY="ゆりこ">Yuriko</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">-san was taken in the very first curse-killing. Nobody would ever suspect </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"With the curse-killings, you can't count on that. 
{PAUSE ""}
This makes the third year we've kept <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE> confined. If someone else gets killed this time, there probably won't be a next year."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Won't be a next year of what?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Of the watch on <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE>."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Shirozaki-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, do you think a curse-killing will happen this year too?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"If there's no point in watching me, then that's what you think, isn't it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"............"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Honestly, I think it'll happen too. Because I'm not the culprit."</STYLE><PG>
"............ 
{PAUSE ""}
I'm going to the bathroom."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"Ah, yes. I'll come with you."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田集集会所.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
"Doing my business while being watched like this, I've gotten used to it by now."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm the one being watched, though..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"But if we aren't in the same place, there's no point in watching <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE>. 
{PAUSE ""}
So I have no choice but to let you see me like this."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Well, I've gotten used to it too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Your</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">―"</STYLE><BR>
"Ah, don't say it! It's embarrassing..."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\集会場.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Say, <STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-kun</STYLE>..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Yes?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
"What's <STYLE ID="1">your</STYLE> real aim?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="1">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Watching <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE> was something <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE> proposed yourself 3 years ago. But the curse-killings don't stop."<PG>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Abyss～深淵に至る窓～.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Well, that's to prove my innocence―"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"That's not it, is it?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"What do you mean...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"If no one gets killed, then <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE>'re the culprit. 
{PAUSE ""}
On the other hand, to prove <STYLE ID="1">your</STYLE> innocence, someone has to be killed. 
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">You</STYLE>'re sacrificing others and having us keep this watch for <STYLE ID="1">your</STYLE> sake alone, aren't you?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"That's..."</STYLE><PG>
"One for all, all for one. 
{PAUSE ""}
Don't you think that goes against this settlement's slogan?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-kun</STYLE>, just what are <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE>―"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\引き戸速い.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
―Th-this is bad! Someone's been killed! Another one's been killed!
{PAUSE ""}
　Over by the graveyard clearing! The head's been smashed in again!
{PAUSE ""}
　<STYLE ID="4" RUBY="しろざき">Shirozaki</STYLE>-san, come quick!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Damn...! <STYLE ID="1">Kotaro-kun</STYLE>, <STYLE ID="1">you</STYLE> stay here!"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\引き戸速い.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
